CommitDate: Tue Nov 3 19:43:31 2026 +1100

    fix: close consuming class grammar and share the painted SVEK model
    
    Retain boundary/action/process/package modifiers and parenthesis endpoints;
    execute complete description fallback and scoped note identities. Render mixed
    symbols, current spot palettes, aligned chrome, and one global painted origin.
    
    Precommitted causal accounts (exact original commits):
    7c784cd3ba7e530226fec5db8d09d0972813ebb9 docs: account for command grammar closure and current symbol images
    4d13ee7b8b49fe28ff76178fc3780bc47b300632 docs: account for bordered chrome dimensions and note declaration scope
    3e91019bb5ed1d0efc9fa66d6f8390eef241135d docs: account for SVEK serialized node origins and painted cloud envelope
    aa5bb750598e170f8fce5bd5599162f9389c7e9f docs: account for group paint ownership and parenthesis link identity
    48438ed090c90de545a0828c64205b4072bd931a docs: account for ordinary package command precedence before symbol grammar
    be1dfda42afdb55e055de74064dd6178a6436b47 docs: account for class group endpoint routing through existing SVEK model
    42e8ff78466d3b6c6b7c3f2a1defdbf8d09c5ba0 docs: account for empty containers, scoped note quarks and magnetic group endpoints
    926f2832e0318b1f0b66fa18a3967233f3c0c1e7 docs: account for symbol padding after merged cluster header dimensions
    c32b7c090b9901072bb5cc555865287517bf6781 docs: account for one painted SVEK origin shared by root and contained notes
    486c9fe9ecf4b85f4578a41a6e1ed018a03a1d4f docs: expose unchanged maker plans under required account schema key
    ee458fb064d859d2a1fdba9e12fc8dd0759cba79 docs: retain original combined accounts with explicit schema projections
    
    Maker evidence so far: 549/833 prepared CLI comparisons; all 36 Java-valid
    parse errors eliminated; 23/23 checker and 31/31 prior maker cases; 30/31
    fresh cases. Main tiers 11188/11251 product, 10497/11251 assisted.
    No acceptance claim: LR group endpoints and shielded interface remain
    counterexamples; frozen baseline and review guards remain red.

